---
const title = "mediakiln + Astro";
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <style>
      body { font: 17px/1.6 system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 48rem; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
      video, img { width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>{title}</h1>
    <p>Plain <code>&lt;video&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> tags, optimized after <code>astro build</code> by the <code>mediakiln/astro</code> integration.</p>
    <img src="/img/cover.jpg" alt="Gradient cover" />
    <video controls src="/media/tour.mp4"></video>
  </body>
</html>
